<section class="block on-soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head"><h2>What we do for companies</h2><p>We have sat on both sides of the table: leading charities, and advising the companies and foundations that fund them. That is what makes the advice practical.</p></div>
    <ul class="services">
      <li><h3>Social value strategy</h3><p>What your business should stand for, where it can make a real difference, and how that connects to growth. Decided at board level, owned across the company.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Measurement and reporting</h3><p>A measurement framework that captures what changes because of what you do, not just what you spend. Honest numbers you can put in a tender, an ESG report or an annual report.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Charity partnership strategy</h3><p>Who to work with, why them, and what both sides will contribute. We help you move from "will you sponsor us?" to a partnership that lasts.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Social value in bids</h3><p>Evidence and wording for the social value sections of tenders, built from what you actually do rather than what sounds good.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Culture and people</h3><p>Giving your employees a meaningful way to contribute, and showing the difference it makes to recruitment, retention and pride in the business.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Regulated sectors and levies</h3><p>Deep experience in the gambling and financial sectors, where charitable contributions are expected and scrutinised. We help you make them count.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

